+<section class="section" id="faq"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><h2>Questions, answered.</h2><p>Still curious? Here's what teams ask us most.</p></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I try a paid plan before subscribing?</summary><p>Yes. Team and Business come with a 14-day free trial. No credit card is needed to start.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Choose yearly billing and get 20% off. We charge the annual amount upfront, based on your number of members.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change or cancel my plan?</summary><p>Change plans or cancel any time from your workspace settings. If you cancel, you keep paid features through the end of your billing period.</p></details><details><summary>What happens when my team grows?</summary><p>Add members whenever you need. Paid plans are billed per active user, and your workspace updates automatically.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer help moving our conversations?</summary><p>Yes. Our support team can help you import messages and files from other chat tools.</p></details></div></div></section>
